Package: curatedMetagenomicData
Title: Curated Metagenomic Data of the Human Microbiome
Version: 3.99.0
Date: 2026-10-31
Description:
    The curatedMetagenomicData package provides standardized, curated human
    microbiome data for novel analyses. It includes species relative
    abundance, marker abundance, marker presence, Bracken species profiles
    and antimicrobial resistance gene depth for samples collected from
    different body sites, read from the public curatedMetagenomicData
    releases through the cmgdr package. Taxonomic abundances for each sample
    were calculated with MetaPhlAn 4 and Kraken2/Bracken, and resistance
    genes with KMA against CARD. The manually curated sample metadata and
    standardized metagenomic data are available as (Tree)SummarizedExperiment
    objects.
